                "text": "Cyberattacks on our health care systems disrupt access to care & threaten the data of millions of patients.\n\nToday in @EnergyCommerce, with AHA National Advisor for Cybersecurity and Risk John Riggi, I highlighted the importance of securing the data of patients in NH & beyond. https://t.co/mvguj8ZHZA",
