                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The FDA plays a vital role in developing new medications, but this is only beneficial if patients can access & afford them.\n\nToday in @EnergyCommerce, I urged my colleagues to support my legislation to encourage competition & ensure approvals are not delayed due to patent gaming. https://t.co/3ULmDG11A9",
