                "quoted_status_profile_username": "NBCNews",
                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Mifepristone is safe & effective\u2014we\u2019ve known this for  20 years.\n\nPersonal & private medical decisions about birth control should be made between patients & their doctors. Pleased to see SCOTUS reject this extreme attempt to restrict access to reproductive health care & abortion.",
