                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Patients deserve to know what they are being charged for when they get medical care.\n\nMy bipartisan FAIR Act would help to create a more transparent health care billing system and protect patients from dishonest billing practices.\nhttps://t.co/Y3BxFeQsXU",
