                "retweet_count": 10,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today\u2019s SCOTUS ruling is a temporary reprieve, not a victory.\n \nI'll keep fighting to ensure that women and patients across the country can access the full slate of reproductive health care, including emergency abortion, regardless of where they live.\nhttps://t.co/z0cWnAjeTN",
