                "quoted_status_profile_username": "liz_elkind",
                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The assault on women\u2019s bodily autonomy and reproductive freedom was never going to stop with the overturning of Roe. \n\nWomen and patients must be able to make the personal, private medical decisions that are right for them and their families, free from government interference.",
