                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The Dobbs decision has created a two-tiered system of medical training for health care providers practicing in states with restrictive abortion bans and those without, jeopardizing their ability to care for patients safely\u2014and it\u2019s only getting worse. https://t.co/8CM41nt2zf",
